      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>The servant of her favor</li>\n<li>B\u016b Sa\u02bfd b. al-Dayy\u0101n</li>\n<li>In the name of God, the merciful, the compassionate.</li>\n<li>My lady, Sitt \u1e62alaf visited me and reported to me what you have instructed her. </li>\n<li>Now, my lady, I have children; so if you deem fit that he/it should be left in my possession, (it is fine with me); </li>\n<li>but if you transfer him/it for me to someone else, you would do me a great favor. </li>\n<li>I am also trustworthy in this matter like two</li>\n<li>legally fit witnesses. So, if you will do this </li>\n<li>for me, your action will be highly appreciated. Farewell.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
